+/* The type of a callback of PLUGIN_NAME_USE.  DECL is the declaration that
+   a name resolves to, or the OVERLOAD or BASELINK of a set of overloaded
+   functions.  LOCATION is the location of the name.  For a qualified name,
+   it is the location of its last name, or a range from its first name to
+   its last name.  */
+
