+				      void *user_data);
+
+/* The type of a callback of PLUGIN_MEMBER_ACCESS.  MEMBER is the member
+   that a class member access designates: a FIELD_DECL, a VAR_DECL, the
+   BASELINK of a set of member functions, or a TEMPLATE_ID_EXPR for a
+   member template.  OBJECT_TYPE is the class type of the object.  LOCATION
+   is input_location when the front end resolves the member, at parse time
+   the last token of the member name.  SPLICE_P is true when a splice
+   designates the member: OBJECT.[:R:].  */
